<template name="desk-settings-dialog" content="settings-dialog-extension">
<head></head>
<body>
  <div id="settings-overlay" class="overlay hidden">
    <div class="settings-dialog">
      <div class="settings-sidebar"><h2>设置</h2><input id="settings-search" class="settings-search" type="text" placeholder="搜索设置..."/><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'general'" setting-page="general">通用</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'model'" setting-page="model">智能体与模型</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'access'" setting-page="access">权限与安全</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'workspace'" setting-page="workspace">工作区</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'notifications'" setting-page="notifications">通知</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'appearance'" setting-page="appearance">外观</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'shortcuts'" setting-page="shortcuts">快捷键</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'account'" setting-page="account">账户</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'terminal'" setting-page="terminal">终端</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'browser'" setting-page="browser">浏览器</button><button class="settings-nav" data-class-active="view.settings.page == 'about'" setting-page="about">关于</button></div>
      <div class="settings-content"><div class="settings-header"><div><h2 id="settings-title">{{view.settings.title}}</h2><p id="settings-description">{{view.settings.description}}</p></div><button id="close-settings">×</button></div>
        <div id="settings-body">
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'general'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>界面语言</strong><p>设置 tokmon-desk 使用的语言</p></div><select id="setting-language" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.language"><option value="简体中文">简体中文</option><option value="English">English</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>启动页面</strong><p>启动后进入上次会话或首页</p></div><select id="setting-startup" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.startup"><option value="首页">首页</option><option value="上次打开的会话">上次打开的会话</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>自动保存</strong><p>编辑器未保存缓冲的自动保存间隔</p></div><select id="setting-autosave" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.autosave"><option value="关闭">关闭</option><option value="1 分钟">1 分钟</option><option value="5 分钟">5 分钟</option><option value="15 分钟">15 分钟</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>更新通道</strong><p>选择稳定版本或预览版本</p></div><select id="setting-channel" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.update_channel"><option value="稳定版">稳定版</option><option value="测试版">测试版</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'model'">
            <div class="setting-card model-setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>模型平台</strong><p>来自当前项目配置；凭据只进入系统安全存储</p></div><div class="model-control"><div id="provider-list" class="provider-list model-provider-list"><button class="provider-row" data-for="provider : view.settings.providers" data-class-selected="provider.selected" data-attr-provider-id="provider.name"><span><strong>{{provider.name}}</strong><small>{{provider.model}}</small></span><em>{{provider.credential_source}}</em></button></div></div></div>
            <div class="setting-card model-setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>主模型</strong><p>发送请求时使用的模型名称</p></div><div class="model-control"><input id="setting-main-model" type="text" data-value="view.settings.main_model"/></div></div>
            <div class="setting-card model-setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>推理强度</strong><p>与旧版标准、高和最高选项一致</p></div><div class="model-control"><select id="setting-reasoning" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.reasoning"><option value="标准">标准</option><option value="高">高</option><option value="最高">最高</option></select></div></div>
            <div class="provider-config-grid"><label>协议<select id="provider-protocol" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.provider_protocol"><option value="openai-compatible">openai-compatible</option><option value="anthropic">anthropic</option><option value="gemini">gemini</option><option value="local">local</option></select></label><label>Endpoint<input id="provider-endpoint" type="text" data-value="view.settings.provider_endpoint"/></label><label>认证<select id="provider-auth" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.provider_auth"><option value="bearer">bearer</option><option value="x-api-key">x-api-key</option><option value="none">none</option></select></label><label>Secret 环境变量<input id="provider-secret-env" type="text" data-value="view.settings.provider_secret_env"/></label><label>API Key<input id="provider-secret" type="password" data-value="view.settings.provider_secret"/></label><div class="provider-actions"><button id="configure-provider" class="secondary-button">保存 Provider</button><button id="test-provider" class="secondary-button">测试连接</button><button id="store-provider-secret" class="primary-button">安全保存 Key</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'access'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>文件访问</strong><p>限定 Agent 可访问的文件范围</p></div><select id="setting-file-access" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.file_access"><option value="受信路径">受信路径</option><option value="仅工作区">仅工作区</option><option value="全部">全部</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>命令审批</strong><p>设置执行本地命令前的确认策略</p></div><select id="setting-command-approval" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.command_approval"><option value="自动执行">自动执行</option><option value="按需确认">按需确认</option><option value="禁止执行">禁止执行</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>联网能力</strong><p>允许模型使用已配置的网络工具</p></div><select id="setting-network" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.network"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>高风险二次确认</strong><p>放弃修改、上传和敏感浏览器操作必须确认</p></div><select id="setting-high-risk" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.high_risk_confirmation"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'workspace'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>当前路径</strong><p>项目文件的真实工作目录</p></div><code class="path-value">{{view.settings.workspace_path}}</code></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>索引模式</strong><p>控制文件搜索和语法索引范围</p></div><select id="setting-index-mode" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.index_mode"><option value="标准">标准</option><option value="智能索引">智能索引</option><option value="深度索引">深度索引</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>自动同步</strong><p>监控文件系统变化并更新工作区视图</p></div><select id="setting-workspace-sync" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.workspace_sync"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>Git 集成</strong><p>显示审查、暂存、提交和推送操作</p></div><select id="setting-git" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.git"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'notifications'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>通知</strong><p>总通知开关</p></div><select id="setting-notifications" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.notifications"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>桌面通知</strong><p>允许系统通知中心显示完成状态</p></div><select id="setting-desktop-notifications" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.desktop_notifications"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>消息提醒</strong><p>新回复到达时发出提醒</p></div><select id="setting-message-alerts" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.message_alerts"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>免打扰时段</strong><p>在指定时段静默通知</p></div><select id="setting-quiet-hours" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.quiet_hours"><option value="关闭">关闭</option><option value="22:00 - 08:00">22:00 - 08:00</option><option value="23:00 - 07:00">23:00 - 07:00</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'appearance'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>主题与颜色</strong><p>技术重写不修改旧版 Tokmon 主题和配色</p></div><span class="locked-value">旧版浅色主题 · 已锁定</span></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>界面密度</strong><p>调整内容间距，不改变组件风格</p></div><select id="setting-density" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.density"><option value="紧凑">紧凑</option><option value="舒适">舒适</option><option value="宽松">宽松</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>界面缩放</strong><p>70%–200%；自动跟随系统显示缩放</p></div><input id="setting-ui-scale" type="number" min="70" max="200" step="5" data-value="view.settings.ui_scale"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>字体缩放</strong><p>保持内容字体可读性</p></div><input id="setting-font-scale" type="number" min="70" max="200" step="5" data-value="view.settings.font_scale"/></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'shortcuts'"><div class="shortcut-table"><div class="shortcut-row"><span>发送消息</span><kbd>Ctrl + Enter</kbd></div><div class="shortcut-row"><span>保存文件</span><kbd>Ctrl + S</kbd></div><div class="shortcut-row"><span>打开文件</span><kbd>Ctrl + P</kbd></div><div class="shortcut-row"><span>打开审查</span><kbd>Ctrl + Shift + G</kbd></div><div class="shortcut-row"><span>终端复制 / 粘贴</span><kbd>Ctrl + Shift + C / V</kbd></div><div class="shortcut-row"><span>释放编辑器或终端焦点</span><kbd>Esc</kbd></div></div></div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'account'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>昵称</strong><p>在本机 UI 中显示的名称</p></div><input id="setting-nickname" type="text" data-value="view.settings.nickname"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>邮箱</strong><p>可选账户联系邮箱</p></div><input id="setting-email" type="email" data-value="view.settings.email"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>云同步</strong><p>同步前仍以当前 Tokmon 配置能力为准</p></div><select id="setting-cloud-sync" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.cloud_sync"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'terminal'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>默认 Shell</strong><p>使用当前平台可用的本地 Shell 或自定义程序</p></div><select id="setting-terminal-profile" class="setting-select" data-value="view.settings.terminal_profile"><option data-for="profile : view.settings.terminal_profiles" data-attr-value="profile.value">{{profile.label}}</option></select></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>自定义可执行文件</strong><p>仅在默认 Shell 选择“自定义可执行文件”时使用</p></div><input id="setting-terminal-executable" type="text" data-value="view.settings.terminal_executable" placeholder="选择终端可执行文件"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>自定义参数</strong><p>支持空格、单引号、双引号和反斜杠转义</p></div><input id="setting-terminal-arguments" type="text" data-value="view.settings.terminal_arguments" placeholder="例如：-NoLogo 或 -l"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>终端字号</strong><p>新建终端标签时应用，并同步调整 PTY 行列网格</p></div><input id="setting-terminal-font-size" type="number" min="9" max="24" data-value="view.settings.terminal_font_size"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>滚动缓冲</strong><p>libghostty-vt 保存的最大可回看行数</p></div><input id="setting-terminal-scrollback" type="number" min="1000" max="100000" data-value="view.settings.terminal_scrollback"/></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>数据边界</strong><p>终端进程、历史和设置仅属于 tokmon-desk</p></div><span class="locked-value">Desktop 本地</span></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'browser'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>系统浏览器</strong><p>优先复用已安装的 Chrome/Chromium 可执行文件</p></div><code class="path-value">{{view.settings.browser_executable}}</code></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>独立 Profile</strong><p>不会修改用户日常浏览器 Profile</p></div><span class="locked-value">强制隔离</span></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>高风险操作</strong><p>上传、下载、权限、支付和密码操作进入用户确认</p></div><select id="setting-browser-confirm" class="setting-select bool-select" data-value="view.settings.browser_high_risk_confirmation"><option value="1">已启用</option><option value="0">已禁用</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <div data-if="view.settings.page == 'about'">
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>tokmon-desk</strong><p>SDL3 + RmlUi + Skia 原生桌面技术重写</p></div><span class="locked-value">开发版</span></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>开源组件</strong><p>RmlUi · SDL3 · Skia · HarfBuzz · FreeType · MD4C · Zep · libgit2 · tree-sitter · libghostty-vt</p></div></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>Browser</strong><p>基础安装包不包含浏览器运行时</p></div></div>
            <div class="setting-card"><div class="setting-copy"><strong>许可声明</strong><p>完整版权与许可文本随发行包的 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md 提供。</p></div></div>
          </div>
          <div id="settings-dialog-extension"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="settings-footer"><span id="settings-status">{{view.settings.status}}</span><button id="reset-settings" class="secondary-button">恢复默认</button><button id="save-settings" class="primary-button">保存更改</button></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</template>
